    "currencyNote": "USD only until non-USD prices are final. Do not add estimated prices.",
    "emailNotice": "Email is not hosted on DronaHost servers. Customers who need business email use Google Workspace or premium email.",
    "changesFromV2": [
      "Plan 'pop' renamed to 'pro'.",
      "Mailboxes removed from all limits. Email hosting is discontinued.",
      "Scale, Dedicated Core and Enterprise moved out of the public plan list into highTraffic (talk to us).",
      "Two Web hosting plans added: essential and plus.",
      "Starter backup retention raised from 1 day to 7 days.",
      "Disk sizes now follow the advisor tables (WordPress 20/60/120 GB, Web 15/50 GB), not the old file (200/500/1000 GB). Confirm which is real.",
      "Site counts capped (Growth 10, Pro 25, Plus 10). No 'unlimited' wording.",
      "Non-USD prices, regions block and first-response times removed.",
      "Unverified performance multipliers removed from includedWithEveryPlan. Each included item now carries a claimId.",
      "Offsite backup add-on collapsed into one add-on with size options.",
      "3.1.0: support channels reduced to ticket and email. WhatsApp, live chat and phone are not offered (owner decision 22, 2026-10-07).",
      "CTA labels follow the 'Choose {plan name}' rule. Badge 'Most Popular' replaced by 'Recommended'."
    ],
    "confirmBeforeLaunch": [
      "All storage, RAM, CPU, site, database, FTP and PHP limits.",
      "Backups are daily and the old one is deleted (owner, 2026-10-08).",
      "Automatic WordPress updates, built-in caching, WP-CLI, Redis object cache, staging and sync, automated plugin testing, WooCommerce optimization.",
      "Advanced security included on Pro, and malware scanning included on Growth and Pro (these are recommendations, not facts).",
      "Free domain for the first year: eligible TLDs, annual billing only, domain renewal price.",
      "Support: channels are ticket and email only (WhatsApp, live chat and phone are not offered). Define what 24/7 means with ticket and email, the business hours and time zone, and the 24/7 scope (Growth, Pro, Plus).",
      "Web plans are unmanaged hosting. They must not claim WordPress-specific management tools.",
      "Business hosting on the site means the Web hosting plans (Essential, Plus). Confirmed by the owner on 2026-10-07.",
      "Fair-use and backup policy pages must exist before the fair-use and backup lines render (see the content planner, Plan 07).",
      "LiteSpeed, NVMe, cPanel, Cloudflare and free SSL statements (add each to content/claims.ts).",
      "Checkout links: replace /checkout?plan=... with the real WHMCS product links.",
      "Cost per account for every plan, including refunds and support time, before publishing prices.",
      "Domain registration pricing is not set in this file yet."
    ]
  },

